# Product Data & Schema

**PostgreSQL only:** `POSTGRES_URL` — no `MONGO_URI`, no fallback (ADR 004). Alembic owns schema.

**Domain:** `stock` in `schemas/`, `models/`; tables `tenants`, `stocks`, `users`, `orders`, …

**Isolation (ADR 005):** one shared PostgreSQL; **`tenant_id`** FK on all domain tables. Uniqueness is per tenant (e.g. `(tenant_id, username)`). Every repository query filters by current tenant.

`schema_version` on rows: optional; not required for SaaS.
